step Piznik
  tip Piznik mines in the Windshear Mine at the east end of the crag. Talk to him and fend off the Venture Co. raiders while he mines.
  tip Careful: The kobolds arrive in waves. The first wave is melee fighters, and the second adds casters to the mix. Regular mobs in the mine respawn quickly and can join the fight while the waves are coming. A group is recommended.
